ires cipher suite / key exchange / fn-ptr introspection APIs\")","+}"]}],"originalFile":"//! Test cases for `picoquictest/mbedtls*.c` (auto-stubbed).\n//!\n//! Generated by `scripts/phase3.py` from\n//! `picoquic_t/picoquic_t.c`'s `test_table[]`.  Each stub\n//! corresponds to one C test entry; bodies are `todo!()`\n//! until the body-translation pass lands.\n\n#![allow(non_snake_case)]\n\n/// C: `mbedtls_test` in `picoquictest/mbedtls_test.c`.\n#[test]\nfn mbedtls() {\n    todo!(\"mbedtls_test\")\n}\n\n/// C: `mbedtls_configure_test` in `picoquictest/mbedtls_test.c`.\n#[test]\nfn mbedtls_configure() {\n    todo!(\"mbedtls_configure_test\")\n}\n\n/// C: `mbedtls_crypto_test` in `picoquictest/mbedtls_test.c`.\n#[test]\nfn mbedtls_crypto() {\n    todo!(\"mbedtls_crypto_test\")\n}\n\n/// C: `mbedtls_load_key_test` in `picoquictest/mbedtls_test.c`.\n#[test]\nfn mbedtls_load_key() {\n    todo!(\"mbedtls_load_key_test\")\n}\n\n/// C: `mbedtls_load_key_fail_test` in `picoquictest/mbedtls_test.c`.\n#[test]\nfn mbedtls_load_key_fail() {\n    todo!(\"mbedtls_load_key_fail_test\")\n}\n\n/// C: `mbedtls_retrieve_pubkey_test` in `picoquictest/mbedtls_test.c`.\n#[test]\nfn mbedtls_retrieve_pubkey() {\n    todo!(\"mbedtls_retrieve_pubkey_test\")\n}\n\n/// C: `mbedtls_sign_verify_test` in `picoquictest/mbedtls_test.c`.\n#[test]\nfn mbedtls_sign_verify() {\n    todo!(\"mbedtls_sign_verify_test\")\n}\n","userModified":false}}
